From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 140/140] PC5: WebView2's installer starts as a program of its own
 (Wine patch 1008)

---
 ...aller-starts-as-a-program-of-its-own.patch | 22 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 wine/patches/1008-ntdll-ps5-webview2-s-installer-starts-as-a-program-of-its-own.patch

diff --git a/wine/patches/1008-ntdll-ps5-webview2-s-installer-starts-as-a-program-of-its-own.patch b/wine/patches/1008-ntdll-ps5-webview2-s-installer-starts-as-a-program-of-its-own.patch
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..50aad21
--- /dev/null
+++ b/wine/patches/1008-ntdll-ps5-webview2-s-installer-starts-as-a-program-of-its-own.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@
+From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: prospero-win <prospero-win@invalid>
+Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:00:00 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] ntdll/ps5: WebView2's installer starts as a program of its own.
+
+With Programs a game starts on, Webview2Setup.exe was refused: its name
+is none of the installers'. Awita: Journey of Hope runs it first.
+---
+diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c b/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
+index 6e24253..52a3573 100644
+--- a/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
++++ b/dlls/ntdll/unix/process.c
+@@ -415,6 +415,9 @@ static BOOL ps5_spawn_allowed( const char *image, const char *command )
+     {
+         "vcredist", "vc_redist", "redist", "dxsetup", "dxwebsetup", "dotnet", "physx", "oalinst",
+         "msiexec", "xnafx", "prereq", "vstor",
++        /* WebView2's runtime installer (Webview2Setup.exe, MicrosoftEdgeWebview2Setup.exe), which a
++         * game with its menus in a web page runs first. */
++        "webview2",
+     };
+     const char *name = strrchr( image, '\\' );
+     char lower[256];
-- 
